    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "msgctxt": "518380",
      "tipo": "popupStd_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "#TVAL02 Sm#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "msgctxt": "518400",
      "tipo": "unk_op1659",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF.",
      "pt": "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "msgctxt": "518456",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF.",
      "pt": "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "msgctxt": "518540",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game.",
      "pt": "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "msgctxt": "518620",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving.",
      "pt": "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "msgctxt": "518688",
      "tipo": "unk_op1653",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Would you like to save your Clear Data?",
      "pt": "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "msgctxt": "518728",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "Are you sure you wish to exit",
      "pt": "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "msgctxt": "518760",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "without saving the Clear Data?",
      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "msgctxt": "518792",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "As if sinking into watery depths,\nwe descend into a dense darkness.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "msgctxt": "518860",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I wonder if #C236196003Rani#CDEF put this shooting star design here in her mind.\nIt's a fitting mental image of astrology, which #C236196003Rani#CDEF likes.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "msgctxt": "519020",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Maybe one could call it mystery? Unfathomable.\nImpossible. Indivisible. Incomprehensible.\nOr, strange. Odd. Uncanny. An enigma.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "msgctxt": "519148",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I don't understand.\nI don't understand.\nIt's always something that I can't grasp.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "msgctxt": "519232",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Among them, #[he][she]# is a superbly incomprehensible\nperson. I'm talking about you, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "msgctxt": "519356",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You've disappointed me. My measurements\nconclude that you have a fatal deficiency\nin ability to regulate your lifestyle.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "519480",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Predicting the actions of hostile objects,\nsmoothing reality-conflicting tumults,\nstoicism reaching for a higher self――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "519604",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "And what you lack most of all \nis respect for your transplendent kouhai, \nwho can teach you all of these things.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "519720",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I want you to improve at once.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "519752",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hm. I recognize the phrasing of that logic.\nVery similar to that of my tutor, Seneca.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "519840",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "So, basically what she's saying is\n\"praise your cute kouhai more.\" That #C236196003Rani#CDEF―\nit seems that she's felt very lonely.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "519976",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "If #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF is a wolf in honors student\nclothing, then #C236196003Rani#CDEF is a spectacled intellectual\npretending to be a machine.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "520128",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It looks like she couldn't resist wanting to\nbe praised by you, on account of\nher shamelessness.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "520228",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "We'll refuse, obviously. No need for that kind\nof improvement. Let's snap this unnecessary\nevent flag right over our knees, Darling鷙",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "520364",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Just desserts for a puppet with a mind. If she's\nnot recognized as useful by humans, then she\ncan't assess her own faculties.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "520492",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "A foolish worry, but indulge her anyway. What?\nProbing into things or humans won't change them.\nIt's about whether you're compatible or not.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "520636",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…no. The problem lies not just with you.\nMan's lack of self-restraint worsens many\nmatters.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "520732",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Seeing what should not be seen;\ntouching what should not be touched;\neating what should not be eaten.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "520836",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "So with the Creator's apple, so with that box\nof hope… so with my secrets.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "520912",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I am #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF.\nA new race of human―granted by man a data\nprocessing capability which surpasses his own.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "521036",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I have to impose a maximum priority observation,\ninstruction, and reform to all of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's\nemotions and actions.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "521168",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I am the helm which steers that purpose.\nThere's no room to involve personal feelings.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "521256",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Truly, absolutely none.\nI will treat my elevated heart rate as I do\nany miscalculation.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "521344",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…it's natural for my cheeks to be flushed.\nI deduce that it's due to my almost burning\nsense of responsibility to my important duty.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "521480",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Aghh! She's perfectly drenched in selfishness!\nIt's not fair!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "521544",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "To begin with, my Praetor's freedom belongs to\nME! Being contracted, raising my Master\nto become first-rate is MY role!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "521664",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…I can't believe it's come to this. There's a\nwoman, extremely enthusiastic about educating,\nwho has her eyes on you, Master.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "521792",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I made light of her. This person is trouble.\nI deem that once she matures, she'll become a\nterribly unsound female scientist or jailer.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "521928",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "There's no need to hold back anymore.\nThis is our chance to make #C236196003RANI#CDEF the\nreformed one, for her sake!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "522048",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "He who uses a machine becomes controlled\nby it―――This is one way in which\ncivilizations frequently meet their end.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "522168",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "With my high computational ability,\nthe control of human actions and emotions\nis a supreme challenge.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "522272",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Controlling someone. I've come to understand\nthat it itself is synonymous with\nacquiring someone's mind.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "522380",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Humans reclaim eternal paradise by throwing off\ntheir worthless fixations and becoming naked,\ndefenseless in mind and body beside me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "522516",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You. Especially you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nYou're foolish, like a sweet fruit.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "522600",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Mustn't you, predominantly and intensively,\nreceive the honor of my teachings?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "522680",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Entrust all of yourself to me. We'll both be\nin a logical and natural form… Ahh, what a\nsplendid plan…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "522788",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Rising body temperature confirmed. Fluctuations\nin pulse and breathing measured. Right now, I'm\nin a drunken state induced by medicine…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "522928",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The voice of her unconscious mind wasn't\nrejecting an invading, foreign body;\nrather, it was filled with an intoxication as if welcoming it.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "msgctxt": "523072",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "What we can do, the only thing we can do,\nis to descend into the #RUBS      Id  #RUBEwellspring#REND of #C236196003Rani#CDEF's\nunconscious mind without damaging it.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "msgctxt": "523240",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 2,
      "en": "―――A journey through an infinitely hallucinating mind.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "msgctxt": "523300",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "After the sensation of a moment―or an eternity―\npassed, I came to see the center of #C236196003Rani#CDEF's mind―――",
      "pt": ""
    }
  ]
}
